# KEDG site — asset guide (Current Batch)

Upload these files to the root or respective folders of your GitHub repo.

## Root Folder Assets (Images)
| File | Used on | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| logo.png | every page | Your official brand logo |
| profile.jpg | Home hero, About hero | **Your retouched portrait** (use your primary portrait photo) |
| studio.jpg | Home (Who we are) | Studio/workspace backdrop photo |
| banner.jpg | Home hero background | Hero background banner image |

## Portfolio Mockups (`work/` folder)
Upload these ready mockup images into the `work/` folder using these exact names:

| File | Case Study Match | Frame | Shape |
|---|---|---|---|
| work/case-01.jpg | Concept AI automation pipeline | laptop | 16:10 landscape |
| work/case-02.jpg | Concept Fintech website system | floating display | ~3:2 landscape |
| work/case-03.jpg | Concept Motion identity | laptop | 16:10 landscape |
| work/case-04.jpg | Concept Fintech UI system | floating display | ~3:2 landscape |
| work/case-05.jpg | Services overview / Additional UI | floating display | ~3:2 landscape |

*(Note: Remaining case slots like phone portraits or extra laptops can be added later as your design team generates them).*
